cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Rational certificates for the exact quantum query complexity of nine open cases of EXACT_{k,l}^n (Ambainis-Iraids-Nagaj conjecture)"
message: "If you use these certificates, please cite this repository."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Anonymous
repository-code: "https://github.com/exact-query-certificates/exact-query-certificates"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-10-20
abstract: >-
  Exact rational Barnum-Saks-Szegedy SDP certificates showing that the exact quantum query
  complexity of EXACT_{k,l}^n equals max{n-k,l}-1 for n=7 {1,5}; n=8 {1,5},{1,6},{2,6};
  n=9 {2,6},{2,7},{1,5},{1,6},{1,7}, confirming the Ambainis-Iraids-Nagaj conjecture in these
  cases, with two independent standalone checkers. Produced with substantial help from an AI
  assistant (Claude, Anthropic).
keywords:
  - exact quantum query complexity
  - EXACT_{k,l}^n
  - Ambainis-Iraids-Nagaj conjecture
  - Barnum-Saks-Szegedy semidefinite program
  - symmetric Boolean functions
  - rational certificate
